        "text": "=🚀 New High-Priority Lead\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Name\n {{ $('Is this data Valid?').item.json.body.name}}\n\n🏢 Company\n {{ $('Is this data Valid?').item.json.body.company}}\n\n📧 Email\n {{ $('Is this data Valid?').item.json.body.email}}\n\n⭐ AI Score\n{{$('Parsing the scoring').item.json.score}} / 100\n\n🔥 Priority\nHigh\n\n📝 AI Summary\n{{$('Parsing the scoring').item.json.summary}}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n📅 Action Required\nFollow up within 24 hours.",
